{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I walk in and sit at a table, ordering a bottle of whiskey and stashing it in my coat pocket. I then start a bit of light carousing, buying drinks for eager patrons and getting drinking songs going.\n(spending 10gp)","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:40:56.580000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868608719003484270","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"A dapper looking shadow born sits down with wintergreen.","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:43:40.996000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868609408614141952","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"<@290612027691368454>","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:43:49.231000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868609443154247740","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Ah, well hello there! Fancy a nip?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:44:21.815000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868609579821461514","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"What what? Indubitably my good chap! I'd never refuse kindness from a musician.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:45:13.820000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868609797946216490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"A musician! A week ago, perhaps. Today I say I have seen real musicians in Empire City, and I am but a talented dabbler.\" I pour a shot for the newcomer, only sloshing a little.","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:47:10.255000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868610286310023178","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"It is the curse of every entertainer to doubt oneself and show on sharp relief their self comparisons. \" he raises his shot glass to wintergreen and drinks it.","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:48:43.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868610677667942490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well I will drink to that.\" I finish my own and extend my hand. \"You may call me Wintergreen, Mister . . .?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:50:18.652000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868611076504317972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Buchanan. It is a pleasure to make your acquaintance.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:51:46.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868611446123139102","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"You are musically inclined yourself, Mister Buchanan? I was just teaching some of these folk a song I know about a forlorn lass and the sea. But if you would like to indulge us with something more refined - \" I draw my battered brass horn from the depths of the coat \"I will gladly accompany you?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:53:48.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868611955911434302","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Buchanan reaches into his void and produces a bass.","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:56:11.272000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868612555499790356","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Lets show these yokels some class.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:56:51.643000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868612724828041216","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Avrae","id":"261302296103747584","is_bot":1,"username":"Avrae"},"author_id":"261302296103747584","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:57:29.693000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868612884421296159","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"It is the song of the pigeons.","created_at":"2021-07-24T21:59:08.961000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868613300781482015","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"The pigeons do infact coo, and the sound of it fills the sewers.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:00:08.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868613549927325736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Buchanan bass line enhances wintergreen's song. It is a lovely duet.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:01:50.145000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868613976836169779","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"Willow enters and watches the performance.","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:03:11.093000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868614316356665454","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"True artists are made from pain and heart break.\" He says after the set is complete. \"Tell me about yourself? Did I guess right?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:03:18.100000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868614345746173972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"What a wonderful performance! May I ask your names?\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:04:03.665000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-24T22:04:16.434000Z","id":"868614536859635723","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"I open my mouth to speak, but nothing comes out. I try again, and fail. On the last attempt, I say, \"I have known much pain and heartbreak since coming here, yes.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:04:12.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868614572599287869","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"M L","id":"290612027691368454","is_bot":0,"username":"mournfulleper"},"author_id":"290612027691368454","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"You may not know me, priestess, but I met your counterpart this morning. You may call me Davidson Wintergreen.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:05:25.148000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868614878624104488","reply_to_id":"868614536859635723","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Pardon me if I am not so formal as my brass blowing counterpart. You may call me Jacob. Propriety be damned! We are living the musicians life today!\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:08:18.226000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868615604565835856","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Nice to meet you, Jacob and Davidson. My name is Willow. I am the priestess of memory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:09:15.599000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868615845205647360","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"863311533328695367","content":"\"Well, the more the merrier I say.\"","created_at":"2021-07-24T22:10:12.113000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868616082242539591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
